# Design system (primary UI reference)

For **visual** UI work, read **[DESIGN.md](../DESIGN.md)** before implementing:

- Color/surface tokens (`--paper`, `--card`, Ember palette)
- **Root rem:** `16px` default, `14px` on `768px–1280px`; Tailwind `--text-*` in `packages/design-tokens/src/tailwind-type-scale.css`
- Typography, radius, form field metrics
- Page layout, scroll contracts, `usePageConfig` chrome (`contentBlend`, `contentStackBackground`)
- Shell, breadcrumbs, secondary nav, data tables (`.ui-canvas-*`, `STICKY_HEADER_CLASS`)
- **Card / table chrome:** use `ui-card-raised` / `ui-card-elevated` / `ui-card-panel` (aliases `ui-canvas-*`). Do **not** add `border`, `bg-card`, `rounded-*`, `hover:bg-*`, or `hover:shadow-*` on the same node — the class owns fill, radius, shadow, and hover. Interactive wrapping `div`s add `ui-card-interactive`. Rows inside a shell use `ui-row-hover`.
- **Elevated cards on `--paper`:** never `hover:bg-accent/*` — the chrome class keeps fill and deepens `--e-3` in place; title underline is optional
- **No layout shift on hover:** no `translate` / `scale` / size changes on card hover — paint-only (shadow, color, underline); see DESIGN.md “Hover & motion”
- **Overflow / 3-dot menus:** Lucide `MoreVertical` (`⋮`) for rows/toolbars; rail overflow is `MoreHorizontal` (`⋯`) — see DESIGN.md

`DESIGN.md` **outranks** shadcn defaults, ad-hoc Tailwind, and external layout references when they conflict.

**Secondary** (flow, not look): `list-detail-edit-ui-conventions.mdc`, `settings-form-section-ui.mdc`, `header-tabs-ui.mdc`, `ui-components.mdc`.

When you establish or change a visual pattern, update `docs/agent/DESIGN.md` in the same change.
